<title>USA: Meridian Industrial files 3 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Meridian Industrial files 3 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Industrial Trust Inc said on Tuesday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 3.0 million shares.</p>
<p>Meridian, an industrial property real estate investment trust, will use proceeds to fund acquisitions and repay debt.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to be completed in the fourth quarter and will be managed by Prudential Securities Inc, Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp and Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co.</p>
